{
  "schema": 1,
  "lab": "spring-dash-stack",
  "name": "lab/spring-dash-stack",
  "solvedIn": "start-c1-none.json",
  "world": "start-c1-none.world.json",
  "requires": "DS_OM",
  "ticks": 42,
  "inputTicks": 72,
  "search": {
    "method": "hand-built and checked by lab replay: press jump with the stick full right and hold it (stick at rest from input 16); the hit on the ceiling spring on tick 18 (momentum.y -575), then a straight-down dash (stick (0, -1), omnidash) on input 19 and stick down after it. The dash stores momentum in preDashMomentum (-562.2) and zeroes it, so nothing decays while it runs and moves 33.4 u a tick on ticks 20-26; the second spring (under the ledge, x 60-140, y -80-0) hits it mid-dash on tick 27 (y -38.1): hitSpring calls endDash (95% of preDashMomentum back, the signs match) and adds -575, so momentum.y -1109.0 and Velocity.y -270 (not the dash end's +10). Fast-falling, the hurtbox is in the strip (top y -412) on ticks 39 (OnTriggerEnter2D) and 40 (Stay, counter 1) only (34.1 and 34.7 u a tick) and in the finish box on tick 42. 72 inputs so a playback shows every ghost to its end. Ghost path: its first 72 physics ticks (--path-ticks 72), as every ghost on this lab."
  },
